{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1423448001:1":{"text":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","source_cn":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA799C0932FF7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423448002:1":{"text":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","source_cn":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE14410FC8C90B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423448003:1":{"text":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","source_cn":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008FEF05976EF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423448004:1":{"text":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","source_cn":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47708CF89BA5723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423448005:1":{"text":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","source_cn":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E75AE7E47944842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423448006:1":{"text":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便宜一些！","source_cn":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3E9ACDBE3F1BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423448007:1":{"text":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","source_cn":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD454DF30A6F1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"好心的祭司","source":"好心的祭司","status":"source"},"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"精明的食品商人","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}